# The Markdown is still the source of truth, but the PDFs are committed so they can
# be downloaded from the repo without cloning it. That is only safe because CI
# rebuilds them on every change to README.md — a generated file committed by hand
# goes stale the first time you edit the source and forget, and a stale CV is worse
# than no PDF at all.
*.docx
.DS_Store

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
